An id key is a spelling of the id slot

```
{id="x"}
# H

</#x>
.
<section id="x">
  <h1>H</h1>
  <p><a href="#x">H</a></p>
</section>
```

```
{#a id="b"}
p
.
<p id="b">p</p>
```

```
*x*{id="data:y"}
.
<p><strong id="data:y">x</strong></p>
```

```
|{id="file:y"} x |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td id="file:y">x</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
{id='a"b&c'}
# H

</#a"b&c>
.
<section id="a&quot;b&amp;c">
  <h1>H</h1>
  <p><a href="#a&quot;b&amp;c">H</a></p>
</section>
```
